    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha mbika ningī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage pye a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Bizagi beela nguno ū nene SEEBA Mulungu wing'we nalī ng'wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ūmò wing'we ankūje nina na ise; nī shilagīlo shane sha Sabato mushikūje. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūgalūka mukandya kūlondeela bamulungu bangī; yaya nūūlū kwibeegeja shiikolile sha kūsula sha kūlamiwa. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ng'ūmfunīja ū SEEBA shakwinha sha būsangī, shisīnzagi mu mbika īyo shikwanukūlwa kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha shenīsho shilī sha kūlyiwa lūshikū lwenūlo ng'washifunījaga, nūūlū ū lwa ntondo yaho; shose shose īsho shilasaage kūshisha kū lūshikū lwa kadatū, ī shenīsho shiigelile kūpemva mu moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū shose shose shūlyiwa kū lūshikū lwa kadatū lwaaho, shitanukūlwa, nguno shasosohalaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ū wa kūshilya akūbalīlwa būkenaagūji, nguno wagimaga kwīta mhayo ūyo agūlemegije SEEBA; ū munhū ng'wenūyo shiigelile akomanyiwe wīnjiwe ū mu banhū bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ng'ūgesa ī shilīīwa ū mu migūnda ying'we, yaya ū kūpūmbīlīja kūshisha kū mbīmbī ja malaale ging'we, yaya nū kūshishokeela īsho shilīsaagīīla ū mu magesa ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu migūnda ying'we ya mizabibu, yaya ū kūbīta mo ng'hangala ibīlī mukūhūlūlaga pye gete a matwajo; ayo galīyūlagala hasī ūlū mulīgesa yaya ū kūgasoleela. Ng'ūgaleka baayūsoleela nabo a bahabī na bageni. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kwiba, yaya kūlomaloma, yaya kwinyeekeja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūlahīla nyamaama mu lina lyane, na kūlīsosohaja ī lina lya ng'wa Mulungu wako. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūsola shikolo sha nzenganwa ng'wiyo mu nyasalasala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūdimīīla mheela ya ntūmami wako būjikū pe, kūshisha ha ntondo dilū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū munhū ūyo atigwaga ūtizūndūka, nūūlū ū mhokū yaya kūntega kīīnhū sha kwipama; ng'ogohage Mulungu wako. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya ū kūbiza na būsolaanhya ū kūbalamula a banhū ūlū balī na mihayo; yaya kūngunīja ū ng'hūbi kūlwa nguno īkī ng'habī, hama yaya nūūlū kūgwīīla kū lwande lwa nsabi. Alīyo namulage būlī munhū",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Būlī munhū:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, būlī nzenganwa ng'wiyo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mu būtūngīlīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūja ūkūbībaga mihayo ya būlomolomo mu banhū ba ng'wing'we; nūūlū kūlembekeja nzenganwa ng'wiyo mihayo ya kūng'wingīja mu nhabaala. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha kwitogwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūnkolwa nzenganwa ng'wiyo mu ng'holò yako, alīyo ng'wīlage hape ū būhūbi wakwe, ūtizūgwa ū bebe mu būhūbi kūlwa nguno yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūūmalīla ng'wiyo shiilī, nūūlū kūng'wikanwa ose ose ū mu banhū ba ng'wing'we; alīyo ntogagwe ū nzenganwa ng'wiyo gīt'ūmo witogelilwe bebe ng'wenekīlī. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gadimagi a malange gane. Yaya kūlekela mitugo jiibyale na jitī ja mbika īmò najo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūhamba mbīyū ja mbika ibīlī mu ngūnda gūmò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaya kūzwala shizwalo sha būlūba wa mbika ibīlī būsangīlīgije hamò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ngosha ūlaala na ng'wanikī nsese ūyo alūnjiwe na ngosha ūngī, alīyo ataalī ū kūtaligūlwa ū mu būsese bokwe, būbīlī wabo bakwinhwa nsango. Gwike batūbūlagwa, nguno ū ng'wanikī ataalī ū kūtungūlwa ū mu būsese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ngosha ng'wenūyo akūlyiwa ihyū, enhe ng'ondi ya ng'holo kū nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla, īfunyiwe kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA kūbiza shitambò sha kwihīga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ondi yenīyo akwītūmamīla ngabīji kūbeeja isangī kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, kūlwa nguno ya shibi shakwe īsho washītile ū ngosha ng'wenūyo; hūna akūlekejiwa ī shibi shakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū mulingīle ū mu sī yenīyo, ntī gose gose ū gwa matwajo ūyo ng'ūgūhamba, ū mu myaka idatū ya kwandya gūbalagi gīkī gūlemejiwe ū kūlyiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gwa kanè pye a matwajo ga ntī gwenūyo gakūbiza shakwinha sheela kūlwa kūnkumīlīja SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu ng'waka gwa kataano, mukwandya kūgalya a matwajo ga ntī gwenūyo. Ū mu gīko hū mukūpandīka matwajo mingī kūtinda. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
